/v1/","context":{"app_id":4613790,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1846651706692688","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"8,888 Wishlists! Four Friends. Four Bikes. Four 8s.","summary":"8,888 Wishlists! 🚲👻Four friends. Four bikes. Four 8s.We had to celebrate this one! :DMost games celebrate round numbers. But here at Spooky Ride, we have a thing for bicycles... and the number 8 looks suspiciously like two bike wheels.So when we hit 8,888 wishlists, we simply couldn't resist!A huge THANK YOU to everyone who's wishlisted Spooky Ride, played the demo, shared a video, streamed the game, sent us feedback or simply cheered us on - it means the world to us. 💚We're now in the final str","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:42:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692688","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1846651706690823","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"Spooky Ride – Steam Next Fest Livestream","summary":"Hop on your bikes and join us for a spooky ride! 🚲👻We're celebrating Steam Next Fest with a livestream of Spooky Ride, our chaotic 1–4 player co-op adventure!Watch us explore haunted locations, solve puzzles, escape creepy monsters, and make some very questionable decisions along the way.The demo is live! Grab your friends, give it a try, and don't forget to wishlist Spooky Ride!What could possibly go wrong?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690823","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1846651706674900","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"Spooky Ride Demo Is LIVE! Can You Survive the Ride?","summary":"Grab your friends, hop on your bikes and get ready for a true adventure! 🌲👣What starts as a simple bike trip into the woods in search of the legendary Bigfoot quickly turns into something much stranger...Explore mysterious locations, solve puzzles together, face unexpected encounters and try not to lose your friends (or your bikes!) along the way!What's waiting for you in the demo?🚲 Bike-powered chaos - Ride, jump, explore and discover what happens when your friends get a little too creative wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:29:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1846018067926508","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"update","title":"One Last Ride — Final Playtest Update!","summary":"One Last Ride - Final Playtest Update! The forest has changed.We’ve just released a major new Spooky Ride Playtest build - with fixes, improvements, polish and plenty of changes based on your feedback.And today, we’re opening the gates to a huge new wave of players.This is the final weekend of the Spooky Ride Playtest.The Playtest will remain available until Monday, when we’ll be switching over to the official Spooky Ride Demo.If you already have Playtest access, now is the perfect time to jump ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T15:17:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1844751498235280","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"Something Strange Has Been Spotted in Spooky Ride","summary":"We’ve been checking some footage from around the world of Spooky Ride, and something keeps showing up where it probably shouldn’t.At first, we thought it was just another creature in the background.Then it started appearing on multiple cameras.And now it seems to be getting closer.Meet one of the stranger encounters waiting for you in Spooky Ride.You’ll be able to explore, ride, investigate and cause chaos together with friends - and apparently, keep an eye out for Bigfoot.We’ll be sharing more ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T19:36:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235280","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1844751498225413","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"The Spooky Ride Playtest 2.0 is available now!","summary":"PLAYTEST Round two is live NOW!Everyone who signed up should already see it sitting in their Steam library. Haven't signed up yet? Hit Request Access on this page and jump in.Here's the short version of what changed: we went through everything from round one - every bug report, every \"this felt off,\" every comment - and spent the time since actually fixing it. This build should feel noticeably better because of you. Not because we guessed what needed work. Because you told us.So thank you, genui","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225413","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1844115010493115","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You, Volunteer Riders! ❤️","summary":"1,500 riders joined the Spooky Ride playtest — thank you!To every one of our volunteer riders who jumped in, crashed, explored, screamed, laughed, got lost, found bugs and told us what worked — and what definitely didn’t: thank you.Your feedback is already helping us make Spooky Ride better.We’ve been going through your reports, comments and gameplay observations, and we’re now working on a polish pass based directly on what we learned from the playtest.That means fixing bugs, improving clarity,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T19:42:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1843481262695665","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"The Spooky Ride Playtest is live!","summary":"It’s live. Everyone who signed up has been let in, so check your Steam library, it should be sitting there. If you haven’t signed up yet, hit Request Access on this page.The PLAYTEST runs until 27.09.2026.Below is the short version of what’s worth trying. You don’t have to follow any of it, but the people who do tend to find the strange stuff first.Before you set offShare your Room ID with your friends so they land in your session, or invite them straight from the pause menu. Spooky Ride is buil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T15:36:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1843481262689706","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest starts Friday. Request access now!","summary":"The Spooky Ride Playtest opens this Friday, 11 September.Signing up takes one click and it’s free. Hit Request Access on this page and that’s the whole process. No keys to chase, no codes to trade, no waiting list to fight over. Everyone who signs up gets in.One to four riders. One very long night in the woods. And a creature called Little Big Foot who’s either your best asset or your biggest problem, depending on how you treat him.Round up three friends before Friday. You’ll want them.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T16:51:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689706","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4613790-1841579228666097","game_id":"steam-4613790","kind":"announcement","title":"Let the ride begin. Watch the announcement trailer","summary":"Hello from the forest!We are SolidGames, and this is the first time we can say it out loud: we are making Spooky Ride, a cozy but spooky co-op puzzle adventure for 1 to 4 players. Today it stops being a secret.So what is it?It was supposed to be a normal bike trip with your squad. The trail ran along the edge of a wild national park, nothing that four people on bikes could not handle. Then something very large stepped out in front of you, and the way back stopped making sense.Stray off the path ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T16:01:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4613790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:20Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:19Z","error_codes":